# 10. System Architecture

The project follows a modular layered architecture.

```text
                +----------------------+
                |       Client         |
                |  Postman / API User  |
                +----------+-----------+
                           |
                           v
                +----------------------+
                |     Flask API        |
                |      Routes          |
                +----------+-----------+
                           |
                           v
                +----------------------+
                |      Models          |
                | Data Access / Logic  |
                +----------+-----------+
                           |
                           v
                +----------------------+
                | Database Connection  |
                +----------+-----------+
                           |
                           v
                +----------------------+
                |        MySQL         |
                |      Database        |
                +----------------------+
```

### Architecture Flow

**Client → Flask Routes → Models → Database Connection → MySQL**

The response follows the reverse direction:

**MySQL → Database Layer → Models → Routes → Client**

