# 27. Workflow

The general workflow is:

```text
Start
  |
  v
Client sends API request
  |
  v
Flask receives request
  |
  v
Validate input
  |
  +---- Invalid ----> Return Error Response
  |
  v
Process request
  |
  v
Perform database operation
  |
  v
Generate response
  |
  v
Return JSON response
  |
  v
End
```

For attendance:

```text
Select Student
      |
      v
Select Subject
      |
      v
Enter Attendance Date/Status
      |
      v
Validate Data
      |
      v
Check Duplicate
      |
   +--+--+
   |     |
 Exists  New
   |     |
 Error   Save
         |
         v
   Return Response
```

